    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your combat training and your experiments with magic have paid off in two ways.</p><p><strong>Arcane Empowerment.</strong> When you attack with a magic weapon, you can use your Intelligence modifier, instead of your Strength or Dexterity modifier, for the attack and damage rolls.</p><p><strong>Weapon Knowledge.</strong> You gain proficiency with Martial weapons, and you can use a weapon you are proficient with as a Spellcasting Focus for your Artificer spells.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-feKD8XQg3iLxBzFQ\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Set the ability of your magic weapons to Intelligence on their attack activities.</p></section>",
